   "title": "India’s health spending triples to ₹4.14 lakh crore, but out-of-pocket share drops to 42.7%: NHA",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/indias-health-spending-triples-to-414-lakh-crore-but-out-of-pocket-share-drops-to-427-nha/article71705136.ece",
