   "title": "Why Anthropic's blockbuster IPO is getting a muted reception in Korea",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/banking-finance/20261115/why-anthropics-blockbuster-ipo-is-getting-a-muted-reception-in-korea",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
