   "title": "Gov't says Nvidia's Korea pledges remain intact despite Jensen Huang's exit",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/tech-science/20261115/govt-says-nvidias-korea-pledges-remain-intact-despite-jensen-huangs-exit",
