   "title": "Bandits attack Zamfara mosque, kill APC e-registration supervisor, abduct worshippers",
   "url": "https://www.premiumtimesng.com/news/top-news/925270-bandits-attack-zamfara-mosque-kill-apc-e-registration-supervisor-abduct-worshippers.html",
   "domain": "premiumtimesng.com",
