   "title": "Estonia to close border with Russia after ‘sabotage attack’ on defense firm",
   "url": "https://www.politico.eu/article/estonia-accuses-russia-of-attempted-arson-attack-on-drone-maker/",
   "domain": "politico.eu",
   "source": "politico.eu",
   "published": "Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:32:13 +0000",
   "_dt": 1794753133.0,
   "ageDays": 0.14,
   "summary": "Estonia has accused Russia's military intelligence service of ordering an attempted arson attack on an Estonian drone maker, prompting Tallinn to threaten to close its border with Russia. Estonia's Internal Security Service, known as KAPO, said intelligence gathered by its officers showed the attack was commissioned by Russia's GRU military intelligence agency. KAPO has warned that Russia is increasingly targeting European defense manufacturers to disrupt military production and deliveries to Ukraine.",
   "summary_zh": "爱沙尼亚指控俄罗斯军事情报机构策划袭击一家爱沙尼亚无人机制造商并纵火，促使塔林威胁关闭与俄罗斯的边境。爱沙尼亚国内安全局KAPO表示，其人员收集的情报显示，这起袭击是俄罗斯GRU军事情报局委托实施的。KAPO警告称，俄罗斯正日益把欧洲防务制造商作为目标，以扰乱军事生产以及向乌克兰交付装备。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Estonia has accused Russia's military intelligence service of ordering an attempted arson attack on an Estonian drone maker, prompting Tallinn to threaten to close its border with Russia. Intruders were found at Threod Systems in Viimsi, outside the Estonian capital, shortly after 3 a.m. on Saturday trying to break into the building with the aim of setting it on fire and causing an explosion, Prosecutor General Astrid Asi said Sunday. Writing on X , Estonian Prime Minister Kristen Michal said: \"This is part of Russia’s broader hybrid war against Europe, with the aim of decreasing support to Ukraine and pressure on Russia. We will not be intimidated.\" Threod's security staff stopped the attack before it could cause significant damage, authorities said. Eight suspects, all residents of neighboring Latvia, were detained. Five have been remanded in custody. Estonia's Internal Security Service, known as KAPO, said intelligence gathered by its officers showed the attack was commissioned by Russia's GRU military intelligence agency. Threod makes long-range reconnaissance and attack drones. \"We will not be intimidated. Together with our allies, we will continue supporting Ukraine and standing firm against Russian aggression,\" Estonia's defense ministry said in a statement on X. The latest attempt follows an August arson attack on Milrem Robotics, which supplies unmanned ground vehicles to Ukraine. Estonian authorities formally blamed Russian intelligence for that incident in September. KAPO has warned that Russia is increasingly targeting European defense manufacturers to disrupt military production and deliveries to Ukraine. The investigation into Saturday's attempted attack remains ongoing",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
